# ==================================
# OpenFOAM Simulation Results
# ==================================

# Time directories (exclude all except 0/)
**/0.[0-9]*/
**/[1-9]*/
**/[1-9][0-9]*/
**/[1-9][0-9][0-9]*/
**/[1-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]*/

# Keep initial conditions
!**/0/

# VTK output (ParaView data)
**/VTK/

# Post-processing time series
**/postProcessing/

# Parallel decomposition
**/processor*/

# Generated mesh data (can be regenerated)
**/constant/polyMesh/
**/constant/*/polyMesh/

# Region splitting artifacts
**/cellToRegion

